    LLM: 'Game: Twenty-Five. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Twenty-Five is the national card game of Ireland. 2-10 players, 52-card deck, 5 cards each. Unique ranking: 5 of trumps is HIGHEST, then J of trumps, then Aâ™¥ (always 3rd trump). Black suits rank low-to-high (A-2-3...10), red rank high-to-low (K-Q-J...A). 'Rob the pack' if dealt A of trumps. Each trick = 5 pts, first to 25 wins.",
    objective: 'To be the first player or team to twenty-five points, scoring five points per trick.',
    gameplay: '5 of trumps always highest. J of trumps always 2nd. Aâ™¥ always 3rd trump. Follow suit (optional for top 3 trumps if only trump held). Rob the pack: swap A of trumps for turned-up card. Win tricks = 5 pts each.',
